<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55319" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-στρώννῡμι</span></b> , also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-ύω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			LXX
			<u>Jb.</u>
			12.23
		</span></i>, Mitteis <i><span class="en">
			<u>Chr.</u>
			31 viii 18
		</span></i>
		<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>: fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρώσω</span>:—
			Pass.
		, fut. -<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρωθήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ju.</u>
					7.14
				</span></i>
			: aor. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εστρώθην</span> (v.
				infr.):—<i>spread out</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλίνην</span> Hierocl.<i><span class="en">
				p.63
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>spread over, cover</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκον . . ῥόδοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>VH</u>
					9.8
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδίον νεκρῶν κατεστρώθη</span>
			<i>was strewed with</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				14.114
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκορπίων κανθήλιον -εστρωμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					14.2.26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>lay low</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάμαρτα καὶ παῖδ᾽ ἑνὶ κατέστρωσεν
					βέλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>HF</u>
					1000
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.64
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς δὲ Ἕλλησι κατέστρωντο οἱ βάρβαροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					9.76
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				8.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
				10.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>layer</i>, in 
				Pass.
			 of vines, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				5.17.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοτάνιον κατὰ τοῦ ἐδάφους -εστρωμένον</span>
			<i>prostrate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.130
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
